[263,294,295],{},"bench-01",[223,297,298,299,303],{},"Les enregistrements qui concernent tout l'hôte (CPU, disque, connexions SSH) n'ont pas de site.\nLes règles regroupent selon l'un de ces niveaux, et les\n",[300,301,302],"a",{"href":130},"périmètres utilisateur"," restreignent qui voit quoi.",[218,305,307],{"id":306},"dune-ligne-de-log-à-une-alerte","D'une ligne de log à une alerte",[309,310,315],"pre",{"className":311,"code":312,"language":313,"meta":314,"style":314},"language-mermaid shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","flowchart LR\n  L[Ligne de log, \u002Fproc, Redis] -->|agent| E[Wolf Event \u002F Wolf Metric Sample]\n  S[Hooks du site] --> E\n  E -->|règle, chaque minute| I[Wolf Incident]\n  I -->|ouverture, réouverture, résolution| C[Canaux]\n","mermaid","",[263,316,317,325,331,337,343],{"__ignoreMap":314},[318,319,322],"span",{"class":320,"line":321},"line",1,[318,323,324],{},"flowchart LR\n",[318,326,328],{"class":320,"line":327},2,[318,329,330],{},"  L[Ligne de log, \u002Fproc, Redis] -->|agent| E[Wolf Event \u002F Wolf Metric Sample]\n",[318,332,334],{"class":320,"line":333},3,[318,335,336],{},"  S[Hooks du site] --> E\n",[318,338,340],{"class":320,"line":339},4,[318,341,342],{},"  E -->|règle, chaque minute| I[Wolf Incident]\n",[318,344,346],{"class":320,"line":345},5,[318,347,348],{},"  I -->|ouverture, réouverture, résolution| C[Canaux]\n",[350,351,352,364,378,389],"ol",{},[353,354,355,356,359,360,363],"li",{},"L'",[254,357,358],{},"agent"," analyse les logs et lit l'état du système. Il envoie des événements et des\néchantillons de métriques toutes les ",[263,361,362],{},"push_interval"," (30 s).",[353,365,366,367,369,370,373,374,377],{},"Le ",[254,368,256],{}," les stocke. Les événements qui ont la même empreinte sont comptés sur une seule\nligne (",[254,371,372],{},"Nombre",", ",[254,375,376],{},"Vu pour la dernière fois",") au lieu de s'accumuler.",[353,379,380,381,384,385,388],{},"Chaque minute, chaque ",[254,382,383],{},"règle d'alerte"," lit sa fenêtre. Quand sa condition est remplie, elle\nouvre un ",[254,386,387],{},"incident"," par groupe, ou alimente l'incident déjà ouvert.",[353,390,391,392,395],{},"L'incident prévient ses ",[254,393,394],{},"canaux"," à son ouverture, à sa réouverture, à son escalade et à sa\nrésolution, jamais à chaque événement.",[218,397,399],{"id":398},"les-objets","Les objets",[227,401,402,412],{},[230,403,404],{},[233,405,406,409],{},[236,407,408],{},"DocType",[236,410,411],{},"Contenu",[246,413,414,457,484,500,533,543,552],{},[233,415,416,421],{},[251,417,418],{},[254,419,420],{},"Wolf Event",[251,422,423,424,373,427,373,430,373,433,373,436,373,439,442,443,446,447,373,450,373,453,456],{},"Quelque chose qui s'est produit : ",[263,425,426],{},"error",[263,428,429],{},"cron_failure",[263,431,432],{},"worker_failure",[263,434,435],{},"security",[263,437,438],{},"host_metric_alert",[263,440,441],{},"deployment",". Possède une catégorie (par exemple ",[263,444,445],{},"web_attack_probe","), une gravité (",[263,448,449],{},"info",[263,451,452],{},"warning",[263,454,455],{},"critical","), un périmètre, un compteur et une charge utile JSON.",[233,458,459,464],{},[251,460,461],{},[254,462,463],{},"Wolf Metric Sample",[251,465,466,467,373,470,373,473,476,477,480,481,483],{},"Une valeur d'une métrique (",[263,468,469],{},"cpu_usage",[263,471,472],{},"http_502",[263,474,475],{},"tls_days_left","…) pour un périmètre à un instant donné. Agrégée dans ",[254,478,479],{},"Wolf Metric Rollup"," par minute et par heure. Voir ",[300,482,168],{"href":169},".",[233,485,486,491],{},[251,487,488],{},[254,489,490],{},"Wolf Alert Rule",[251,492,493,497,498,483],{},[494,495,496],"em",{},"Quand X > Y pendant Z minutes, envoyer une alerte."," Signal, agrégation, fenêtre, regroupement, canaux. Voir ",[300,499,91],{"href":92},[233,501,502,507],{},[251,503,504],{},[254,505,506],{},"Wolf Incident",[251,508,509,510,373,513,516,517,520,521,373,524,373,527,530,531,483],{},"Des événements qui partagent une cause, pour un groupe d'une règle. Statut ",[254,511,512],{},"Ouvert",[254,514,515],{},"Acquitté"," ou ",[254,518,519],{},"Résolu"," (",[263,522,523],{},"Open",[263,525,526],{},"Acknowledged",[263,528,529],{},"Resolved"," dans l'API). Lié au déploiement qui l'a précédé. Voir ",[300,532,106],{"href":107},[233,534,535,540],{},[251,536,537],{},[254,538,539],{},"Wolf Silence",[251,541,542],{},"Une fenêtre de maintenance : les incidents s'ouvrent toujours, les notifications attendent.",[233,544,545,549],{},[251,546,547],{},[254,548,35],{},[251,550,551],{},"Un hôte enregistré, un site satellite ou une intégration, avec son dernier envoi et son décalage d'horloge.",[233,553,554,559],{},[251,555,556],{},[254,557,558],{},"Wolf Settings",[251,560,561],{},"Rétention, signaux, agents, export SIEM, renseignement sur les menaces.",[218,563,565],{"id":564},"gravité","Gravité",[223,567,568],{},"Chaque gravité a une couleur et une forme, pour ne jamais dépendre de la couleur seule :",[227,570,571,583],{},[230,572,573],{},[233,574,575,577,580],{},[236,576,565],{},[236,578,579],{},"Symbole",[236,581,582],{},"Signification",[246,584,585,597,609,621],{},[233,586,587,591,594],{},[251,588,589],{},[263,590,449],{},[251,592,593],{},"○",[251,595,596],{},"Bon à savoir.",[233,598,599,603,606],{},[251,600,601],{},[263,602,452],{},[251,604,605],{},"◐",[251,607,608],{},"À regarder dans la journée.",[233,610,611,615,618],{},[251,612,613],{},[263,614,455],{},[251,616,617],{},"●",[251,619,620],{},"Quelqu'un est réveillé.",[233,622,623,626,629],{},[251,624,625],{},"resolved",[251,627,628],{},"✓",[251,630,631],{},"Retour à la normale.",[218,633,635],{"id":634},"déploiements","Déploiements",[223,637,638,639,641,642,645,646,649,650,653],{},"Un événement ",[263,640,441],{}," marque le moment où le code a changé : un ",[263,643,644],{},"bench migrate"," sur le site\nWolf, une tâche Pilot, ou ",[263,647,648],{},"wolf-agent mark-deployment",". Les règles peuvent exiger un\ndéploiement récent (la règle prédéfinie ",[494,651,652],{},"502 spike after deployment","), et les incidents affichent\nle déploiement qui les a précédés, si bien que la chronologie se lit « les 502 ont commencé\n4 minutes après le déploiement de 01:47 ».",[218,655,657],{"id":656},"où-regarder","Où regarder",[659,660,661,675],"ul",{},[353,662,663,666,667,670,671,674],{},[254,664,665],{},"Wolf UI"," sur ",[263,668,669],{},"\u002Fwolf"," : la sécurité du bench (sa page d'accueil, ",[254,672,673],{},"Aperçu","), incidents,\nexplorateurs, sécurité, exploitation, supervision. Pour les Wolf Users et les Wolf Managers.",[353,676,677,680,681,483],{},[254,678,679],{},"Desk"," : tous les DocTypes, la configuration, des rapports comme ",[254,682,683],{},"Wolf Incident Metrics",[685,686,687],"style",{},"html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}html.dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}",{"title":314,"searchDepth":321,"depth":327,"links":689},[690,691,692,693,694,695],{"id":220,"depth":327,"text":221},{"id":306,"depth":327,"text":307},{"id":398,"depth":327,"text":399},{"id":564,"depth":327,"text":565},{"id":634,"depth":327,"text":635},{"id":656,"depth":327,"text":657},"Les quelques objets qui composent Dodock Wolf, et comment une ligne de log devient une alerte.","md",null,{},{"icon":21},{"title":18,"description":696},"D1X7JM8ylTKY7uf-f7yh-ZRIETmKDqR91RgEJS6LLsE",[704,706],{"title":13,"path":14,"stem":15,"description":705,"icon":16},"Installez la Wolf App, placez un agent sur l'hôte et obtenez une première alerte, sur un bench.",{"title":30,"path":31,"stem":32,"description":707,"icon":33},"Installez l'application Frappe qui stocke les données de Wolf, évalue les règles et sert la Wolf UI.",1795107945005]